			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 26.46%;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom: none;border-right: none;padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt" valign="top" width="26%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 11.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маданият ва туризм вазирлиги тизимидаги «Фарғона ҳайвонот боғи» давлат муассасаси.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 29.52%;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom: none;border-right: none;padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt" valign="top" width="29%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 11.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги ҳузуридаги «Фарғона ҳайвонот боғи» давлат муассасаси.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 40.74%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom: none;padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt" valign="top" width="40%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 11.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлигининг ташкилий тузилмасига унга ажратилган штат бирликлари билан киритилмоқда.</span></p>
